      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "aU",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Always free: help, check-in, journal,\nbasic report, export and delete.\n\nThe backup stays out of iCloud (Apple\nguideline 5.1.3) and exists only in the paid plan.\n\nSmall actions: a catalogue with clinical\nco-authorship and review, framed as\nwell-being, after regulatory consultation.\nNo completion %; the \"lighter day\"\nis always an offer (SP-19).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1705788106,
      "strokeColor": "#645E57",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Always free: help, check-in, journal,\nbasic report, export and delete.\n\nThe backup stays out of iCloud (Apple\nguideline 5.1.3) and exists only in the paid plan.\n\nSmall actions: a catalogue with clinical\nco-authorship and review, framed as\nwell-being, after regulatory consultation.\nNo completion %; the \"lighter day\"\nis always an offer (SP-19).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1791665132142,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 478328548,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
